                            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-4 mb-4">
                                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">จัดการสไลด์โฆษณา (Carousel)</h3>
                                    <button type="button" id="add-banner-btn" class="bg-primary text-white px-4 py-2 rounded shadow hover:bg-primary/90 transition text-sm font-semibold">
                                        + เพิ่มสไลด์ใหม่
